    "title": "Rare Frank Lloyd Wright Home On Cedar Lake Lists For $2.495 Million - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alexis Johnson ,\n11 hours ago\n1623 Cedar Lake Pkwy — Reported Lake Overlooked By Neils House. A Frank Lloyd Wright-designed home overlooking Cedar Lake in Minneapolis has hit the market for just under $2.5 million. The Frieda and Henry J. Neils House, a Usonian-style residence built in 1951, sits on a nearly half-acre lot and is one of only two homes Wright ever designed in the city.\nRead full article",
